From 2ab545dc08426ede4d254e17678bcbc92174faae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 03:32:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] radv/darwin: Navi 44 (RX 9060 XT, gfx1200) canned entry, chip
 chosen from the kext's QueryInfo gc_version

- amdgpu_devices.c: a gfx1200 entry (1002:7590, ext_rev 0x41, 2 SE x 2 SA x 8 CU,
  8 RB, 16 TCC, 128-bit, 4 MiB L2, 32 MiB MALL, GB_ADDR_CONFIG 0x08200545, CP fw =
  gc_12_0_0 in linux-firmware bda6eccc3a8f). Topology and device fields are
  confirmed by an amdgpu DRM_INFO dump from the target RX 9060 XT; live output is
  preserved in .omo/evidence/navi44-topology/linux-amdgpu-dump.txt.
- ac_darwin_drm.c: the shared core picks the chip after QueryInfo
  (0x0c0001 gfx1201 / 0x0c0000 gfx1200; 0 = pre-Navi44 kext -> gfx1201; unknown ->
  -ENODEV). RADV_DARWIN_CHIP=gfx1200|gfx1201 forces it (and is the HOST_BO
  stand-in's choice, default gfx1201). GB_ADDR_CONFIG is checked against the
  chosen entry; marketing name follows the chip.
- ac_darwin_mock.c: RADV_DARWIN_MOCK_GC=gfx1200 reports GC 12.0.0.
---
 src/amd/common/amdgpu_devices.c        | 130 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/amd/common/darwin/ac_darwin_drm.c  | 108 ++++++++++++++------
 src/amd/common/darwin/ac_darwin_mock.c |   4 +-
 3 files changed, 211 insertions(+), 31 deletions(-)

